# Class: <http://purl.org/OpenPVSignal/OpenPVSignal.owl#Information_Component__025_(IC025)> (Information Component 025 (IC025))

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.org/OpenPVSignal/OpenPVSignal.owl#Information_Component__025_(IC025)> "IC025 is the lower end of a 95% credibility interval for the Information Component. A positive IC025 value is the traditional threshold used in statistical signal detection at UMC. IC025 is also used as one component of the disproportionality parameter in the vigiRank method."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.org/OpenPVSignal/OpenPVSignal.owl#Information_Component__025_(IC025)> "https://www.who-umc.org/vigibase/vigilyze/analytics-in-vigilyze/"^^xsd:string)
