AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.org/OpenPVSignal/OpenPVSignal.owl#Proportional_Reporting_Ratio_(POR)> "Depicts the extent to which a particular adverse effect is reported for individuals taking a specific drug, compared to the frequency at which the same adverse event is reported for patients taking some other drug (or who are taking any drug in a specified class of drugs)."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.org/OpenPVSignal/OpenPVSignal.owl#Proportional_Reporting_Ratio_(POR)> "Proportional Reporting Ratio (PRR)"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.org/OpenPVSignal/OpenPVSignal.owl#Proportional_Reporting_Ratio_(POR)> OpenPVSignal:Disproportionality_Analysis_Measure)

