DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2012_m_Dronedarone_hyperthyroidism_decreased_TSH_4th:mechanismOfAmiodaroneToxicity "Adverse effects of amiodarone include various thyroid disorders, some attributed to its iodine content and others considered inherent effects of amiodarone. 
The effects on the thyroid due to the iodine content of amiodarone are hypothyroidism in patients with autoimmune thyroid disease and hyperthyroidism in patients with autonomous function in a nodular goitre."^^xsd:string)

