rhinosinusitis. Systemic absorption is possible from the nasal spray although bioavailability is regarded as low. Common AEs of the nasal preparation include headache, epistaxis and nasal reactions. Other AEs include rare hypersensitivity reactions and disturbances of taste and smell.2"^^xsd:string)
