DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2012_m_fesoterodine_gi_haemorrhage_6th:UK_SPCs_for_drugs_associated_with_gastric_irritation "Two of the reports list concomitant non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs (NSAIDs) and three other reports list other concomitant medications (oxycodone, bendroflumethiazide, tramadol) described as being associated with \"gastric irritation\" in UK SPCs."^^xsd:string)

