# Individual: X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_15 (info case 15)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_15 "info case 15"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_15)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_15 "In case 15, thrombocytopenia may be related to the co-suspected drug teicoplanin (time to thrombo-cytopenia onset is reported 11 days after teicoplanin treatment and 56 days after abiraterone treatment)."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_20 (info case 20)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_20 "info case 20"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_20)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_20 "Case 20 reports the death of a man after three days of abiraterone/prednisone treatment (disease progression is also mentioned as an adverse effect)."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_24 (info case 24)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_24 "info case 24"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_24)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_24 "In case 24, a 63-year-old patient with advanced metastasic prostate cancer (bone and liver metastases and urinary tract obstruction) presented with acute renal failure, thrombocytopenia and hyperbilirubinemia 58 days after starting abiraterone/prednisone treatment; thrombocytopenia was assessed as not related, hepatic insufficiency as possible and hyperbilirubinaemia as probable (patient from clinical trial)."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_25 (info case 25)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_25 "info case 25"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_25)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_25 "In case 25, with causality assessed as very likely/certain, a 70-year-old patient hospitalized because of symptoms of pulmonary embolism 66 days after having started the therapy with abiraterone also presented with non-serious thrombocytopenia (54.000 platelets/mL). This patient, with a medical history of pulmonary embolism and with a long-term dalteparin treatment as preventive therapy, was diagnosed with acute myeloid leukemia two months later ."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_5 (info case 5)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_5 "info case 5"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_5)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_5 "In case 5 (from clinical trial COU-AA-302, causality assessed as certain) a 69-year-old patient was hospitalized because of grade 3 thrombocytopenia, which worsened in spite of administration of one pack of platelet concentrate together with two packs of blood cells concentrate; he also presented with grade 2 anaemia; further biopsia revealed carcinosis."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_7 (info case 7)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_7 "info case 7"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_7)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2013_m_abiraterone_6th_2013:info_case_7 "Case 7 reports the death of a man after 76 days of abiraterone treatment; no time to onset is reported. Other adverse effects are also reported for this patient, including oedema peripheral and hypokalemia."^^xsd:string)

