# Individual: X2013_m_ptu_2nd_2013:Hyperthyroidism (hyperthyroidism pathophysiology)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2013_m_ptu_2nd_2013:Hyperthyroidism "hyperthyroidism pathophysiology"^^xsd:string)
