# Individual: X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:SummaryContent (Summary content)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:SummaryContent "Summary content"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Summary X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:SummaryContent)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:SummaryContent X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:Ref.1)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:SummaryContent "VigiBase™ contains 122 individual case safety reports (ICSRs) of deafness, 324 ICSRs of tinnitus and 24 ICSRs of hyperacusis associated with the use of fluoxetine. These reactions are included in the US Product Information (PI)1 and the number of cases reporting a positive de- and rechallenge strengthens the likelihood that there is a causal relationship."^^xsd:string)

