# Individual: X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:ototoxicity_studies_for_antidepressants (ototoxicity studies for antidepressants)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:ototoxicity_studies_for_antidepressants "ototoxicity studies for antidepressants"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(obo:OAE_0001125 X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:ototoxicity_studies_for_antidepressants)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_adverse_effect X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:ototoxicity_studies_for_antidepressants <http://purl.org/OpenPVSignal/Signals/2013_3_fluoxetine_deafness#Hearing_impairment_(SMQ)>)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_class X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:ototoxicity_studies_for_antidepressants X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:Selective_serotonin_reuptake_inhibitors)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:ototoxicity_studies_for_antidepressants X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:Ref.11)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:ototoxicity_studies_for_antidepressants X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:Ref.12)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2013_m_fluoxetine_and_deafness_2013_3rd:ototoxicity_studies_for_antidepressants "\"Some researchers tried to associate changes in several objective determinations of the hearing system (from otoscopy to the measurement of the central component of audition as brainstem responses) to the use of antidepressants in both depressed patients and non-depressed controls.
Results showed significantly smaller transient evoked emissions, higher SCAN-A (auditory processing test) composite scores, and smaller amplitude growth functions for auditory brainstem response peak V and auditory late response peak N(1)P(2) while on SSRI medication.11,12 Nevertheless, there is not a direct clinical correlation between the changes in those parameters and the clinical level of hearing, and the results must be taken with caution.\""^^xsd:string)

