# Individual: X2013_m_agomelatine_and_QT_prolonged_4th:DiscussionAndConclusion (Discussion and Conclusion)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2013_m_agomelatine_and_QT_prolonged_4th:DiscussionAndConclusion "Discussion and Conclusion"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Conclusion X2013_m_agomelatine_and_QT_prolonged_4th:DiscussionAndConclusion)
