ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2013_m_baclofen_and_renal_failure_6th:InVivoExperimentsOpposingTheProposedConnectionbaclofen-renalFailure X2013_m_baclofen_and_renal_failure_6th:Ref.6)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2013_m_baclofen_and_renal_failure_6th:InVivoExperimentsOpposingTheProposedConnectionbaclofen-renalFailure "However, a second paper presents data, again in rats, showing that intravenous baclofen, whilst suppressing renal sympathetic activity, appear to prevent ischaemia-reperfusion injury.6 No relevant data from studies in humans could be found in a search of PubMed."^^xsd:string)

