# Individual: X2014_m_roflumilast_and_pancreatitis_1st:Roflumilast_and_Pancreatitis (Roflumilast and Pancreatitis)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2014_m_roflumilast_and_pancreatitis_1st:Roflumilast_and_Pancreatitis "Roflumilast and Pancreatitis"^^xsd:string)
