DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_vemurafenib_2014_and_granulocytopenia_1st:other_concomitant_drugs_associated_with_ADRs "Nine of the ICSRs in which vemurafenib was the only suspected drug included at least one concomitant medicine that has been associated with leucopenia, neutropenia and/or agranulocytosis (according to the UK SPC10). Dates of administration for the concomitant medicines were provided in only four of these cases; three of the cases included concomitant medicines with start dates that suggested the drug could also be implicated in the granulocytopenia."^^xsd:string)

