# Individual: X2014_m_dronedarone_and_av_block_3rd:PALLAS_trial (PALLAS trial)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2014_m_dronedarone_and_av_block_3rd:PALLAS_trial "PALLAS trial"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(obo:OAE_0001182 X2014_m_dronedarone_and_av_block_3rd:PALLAS_trial)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_drug X2014_m_dronedarone_and_av_block_3rd:PALLAS_trial X2014_m_dronedarone_and_av_block_3rd:dronedarone)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2014_m_dronedarone_and_av_block_3rd:PALLAS_trial X2014_m_dronedarone_and_av_block_3rd:Ref.10)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_dronedarone_and_av_block_3rd:PALLAS_trial "An article reporting results from the PALLAS trial does not mention AV block as an adverse effect. There were 13 deaths because of cardiac arrhythmia (2.5%) in the dronedarone group and four deaths (0.8%) in the placebo group, types of arrhythmia are not stated.10 A third of the patients were treated with digoxin, in this subgroup study medication was permanently discontinued prematurely in 21% of patients with dronedarone and in the 11% of patients with placebo, causes are not stated.10"^^xsd:string)

