ClassAssertion(obo:OAE_0001182 X2014_m_ibuprofen_2014_2nd:confoundingEffectOfDiclofenac)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_adverse_effect X2014_m_ibuprofen_2014_2nd:confoundingEffectOfDiclofenac X2014_m_ibuprofen_2014_2nd:acuteRenalFailure)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_drug X2014_m_ibuprofen_2014_2nd:confoundingEffectOfDiclofenac X2014_m_ibuprofen_2014_2nd:diclofenac)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_ibuprofen_2014_2nd:confoundingEffectOfDiclofenac "Diclofenac, another NSAID drug, was taken together with ibuprofen and/ or metamizole in four cases, in one case as a long-term treatment with a dose of 75 mg three times a week. This triple treatment might have added even more to the negative effects on the kidney."^^xsd:string)

