DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_ibuprofen_2014_2nd:info_case_15 "In the other case acute renal failure, sepsis, marrow depression, azotaemia, and condition aggravated was reported acute in a 77-year-old female. Zoledronic acid and ibuprofen were reported as suspected agents in this case."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2014_m_ibuprofen_2014_2nd:info_case_5 (info case 5)

