DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_ibuprofen_2014_2nd:info_case_5 "In one fatal case hepatocellular damage, cholestatic hepatitis and cardio-respiratory failure besides acute renal failure was reported in a 39-year-old female treated with different drugs, among these isotretinoin, which was considered the suspected agent for the liver reactions."^^xsd:string)

