# Individual: X2014_m_tocilizumab_2nd:Literature_and_Labelling (Literature and Labelling)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2014_m_tocilizumab_2nd:Literature_and_Labelling "Literature and Labelling"^^xsd:string)
