DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_tocilizumab_2nd:TNF_inhibitors_and_psoriasis "In their respective summaries of product characteristics (SPCs), psoriasis is recognised as a possible adverse effect of tumour necrosis factor (TNF) inhibitors and abatacept, a costimulation blocking soluble fusion protein.6,7 Like tocilizumab, both are biologic disease-modifying anti-rheumatic agents."^^xsd:string)

