ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2014_m_ustekinumab_and_vasculitis_3rd:TNFa_inhibitors_and_vasculitis X2014_m_ustekinumab_and_vasculitis_3rd:Ref.16)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_ustekinumab_and_vasculitis_3rd:TNFa_inhibitors_and_vasculitis "Agents from the therapeutically related class TNF-α inhibitors, e.g. the monoclonal antibodies adalimumab, etanercept and infliximab, have been labelled with immunologic reactions including cutaneous and/or systemic vasculitis.14-16 Repeated treatment with these agents has been observed to lead to the development of autoantibodies including antinuclear antibodies and ANCA, with the manifestation of clinical vasculitis in rare instances.12"^^xsd:string)

