DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_ustekinumab_and_vasculitis_3rd:case6 "The positive antinuclear factor test reported in case number 6 with ustekinumab as the single reported drug indicates the possibility of a similar mechanism of induction of vasculitis by this agent."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2014_m_ustekinumab_and_vasculitis_3rd:case8 (info case 8)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2014_m_ustekinumab_and_vasculitis_3rd:case8 "info case 8"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2014_m_ustekinumab_and_vasculitis_3rd:case8)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_ustekinumab_and_vasculitis_3rd:case8 "If yet rare, there are reported incidences of serum sickness (PT serum sickness) associated with ustekinumab treatment reported to VigiBase, one of which is represented by case number 8) in the series reflected above. The referred ICSR does however indicate that a medication error related problem occurred (primary source stating suspected incorrect storage of drug), which may explain the unexpectedly long time-to-onset (866 days) and negative rechallenge when therapy was resumed"^^xsd:string)

