DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_agomelatine_and_hypotension_4th:timeToOnsetContent "Time to onset was reported in nine cases (one to five days in six cases, eight days after dose increase in one report, 39 days and 1 year 3 months in two other reports) and remains unknown in three cases. In one case, orthostatic hypotension and other symptoms lasted for twelve hours after each agomelatine intake"^^xsd:string)

