ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_drug X2014_m_dronedarone_and_polyneuropathy_4th:arzneitelegramm X2014_m_dronedarone_and_polyneuropathy_4th:dronedarone)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_dronedarone_and_polyneuropathy_4th:arzneitelegramm "The German arzneitelegramm published a case report of polyneuropathy and visual disturbance in 2012; a 50-year-old man developed polyneuropathy with stocking-like loss of sensibility in the left foot as well as visual problems after taking dronedarone for just under one year. The patient had not yet recovered one year after discontinuing the medication."^^xsd:string)

