DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_dronedarone_and_polyneuropathy_4th:infoForCase6 "One patient was reported to have a pre-existing diabetic neuropathy that worsened after administration of dronedarone and went back to baseline after discontinuation "^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2014_m_dronedarone_and_polyneuropathy_4th:infoForCase7 (info for case 7)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2014_m_dronedarone_and_polyneuropathy_4th:infoForCase7 "info for case 7"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2014_m_dronedarone_and_polyneuropathy_4th:infoForCase7)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_dronedarone_and_polyneuropathy_4th:infoForCase7 "Case 7 reports that the patient had been treated with oxaliplatin, 5FU and folinic acid two years previously and had experienced paraesthesia after every administration. The extensive neurological examinations performed were not conclusive and it is possible that the adverse drug reactions (ADRs) reported in 2012 were still related to the previous chemotherapy."^^xsd:string)

