ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2014_m_dronedarone_ventricular_arrhythmia_6th:FAERSAnalysisOfDronedarone X2014_m_dronedarone_ventricular_arrhythmia_6th:Ref.5)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2014_m_dronedarone_ventricular_arrhythmia_6th:FAERSAnalysisOfDronedarone X2014_m_dronedarone_ventricular_arrhythmia_6th:Ref.6)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_dronedarone_ventricular_arrhythmia_6th:FAERSAnalysisOfDronedarone "Moreover, in 2012 the proarrhythmic potential of dronedarone was analyzed in a review of the FDA adverse event reporting system (FAERS) database. In this study, several reports with ventricular arrhythmias or cardiac arrest, as well as torsade de pointes were found.5 The authors concluded that further investigation regarding this issue is necessary.6"^^xsd:string)

