# Individual: X2014_m_pamindronic_acid_and_optic_neuritis_5th:timeToOnsetInfo (time to onset info)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2014_m_pamindronic_acid_and_optic_neuritis_5th:timeToOnsetInfo "time to onset info"^^xsd:string)
