DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_pamindronic_acid_and_optic_neuritis_5th:timeToOnsetInfo "Time to onset was reported with clarity in only two of the reports and ranged from the same day that the drug was most recently administered to one day after admi- nistration. For a drug which is administered once every three or four weeks, as it is in the treatment of bone metastases which is the indication in the majority of reports, time to onset is most meaningful when related to the most recent administration."^^xsd:string)

