DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_agomelatine_and_thrombocytopenia_6th:EMAReportSeptember2013 "In September 2013 the EMA also presented an overview of agomelatine, including two cases of thrombocytopenic purpura. In both cases positive dechallenges were reported but overall the evidence was not considered sufficient to conclude that there was an association. The MAH was requested to keep agomelatine and thrombocytopenic purpura under close monitoring.8"^^xsd:string)

