DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2014_m_agomelatine_and_thrombocytopenia_6th:info_case_5 "In case 5 the agomelatine dose was not changed and the patient did not recover but the sender stated that, according to the oncologist, the role of agomelatine was rather unlikely, as the worsening of thrombocytopenia could be the natural evolution of the idiopathic thrombocytopenia (natural variation between 30.000 and 150.000), or the consequence of cortisone dose decrease."^^xsd:string)

