ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references <http://purl.org/OpenPVSignal/Signals/2014_2_ibuprofen_metamizole_acute_renal_failure#Mechanism_ibuprofen/metamizole> X2014_m_ibuprofen_2014_2nd:ref1)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content <http://purl.org/OpenPVSignal/Signals/2014_2_ibuprofen_metamizole_acute_renal_failure#Mechanism_ibuprofen/metamizole> "Ibuprofen is a non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drug (NSAID), a class of medications widely used for their analgesic and anti-inflammatory benefits.  Both ibuprofen and metamizole inhibit cyclooxygenase (COX), but metamizole has a different mode of action compared to classical COX-inhibitors.1"^^xsd:string)

