DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content <http://purl.org/OpenPVSignal/Signals/2014_4_dronedarone_polyneuropathy#DiTrapani/Freeman> "At the 2011 International Conference of the American Thoracic Society, Di Trapani and Freeman presented a case of dronedarone induced neurotoxicity involving the central nervous system; a 75-year-old woman developed encephalopathy, tremor, myoclonic jerking and incoordination under dronedarone. A most extensive diagnostic work up yielded no explanation. The symptoms improved after discontinuation of dronedarone"^^xsd:string)

