DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_Hexetidine_and_severe_hypersensitivity_1st_2015:MechanismContent "Hexetidine is a local broad spectrum antimicrobial active against gram positive and negative bacteria, as well as yeasts and fungi, and it is indicated for the treatment of minor mouth infections and pre- and post-dental surgery."^^xsd:string)

