# Individual: X2015_m_linagliptin_cardiac_failure_1st_2015:DetailedMechanismOfDPP4InhibitionAndCardiacFailure (Detailed mechanism of DPP4 inhibition and cardiac failure)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2015_m_linagliptin_cardiac_failure_1st_2015:DetailedMechanismOfDPP4InhibitionAndCardiacFailure "Detailed mechanism of DPP4 inhibition and cardiac failure"^^xsd:string)
