# Individual: X2015_m_linagliptin_cardiac_failure_1st_2015:caseInfo10A (case info 10)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2015_m_linagliptin_cardiac_failure_1st_2015:caseInfo10A "case info 10"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2015_m_linagliptin_cardiac_failure_1st_2015:caseInfo10A)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2015_m_linagliptin_cardiac_failure_1st_2015:caseInfo10A X2015_m_linagliptin_cardiac_failure_1st_2015:Ref.11)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_linagliptin_cardiac_failure_1st_2015:caseInfo10A "Case 10 reports hypertension pulmonale, cor pulmonale and lung fibrosis . "^^xsd:string)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_linagliptin_cardiac_failure_1st_2015:caseInfo10A "In case 10, a 67 year-old woman with a history of scleroderma, lung fibrosis and pulmonary hypertension presented with atrial fibrillation and cardiac failure after approximately six months in treatment with linagliptin. The reporter, a physician, mentions an article of Scirica et al., published the previous month.11"^^xsd:string)

