DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_brentuximab_and_hepatic_disorders_2nd:alternative_explanations "Alternative explanations for two of the fatalities were pulmonary aspergillosis and necrotising vasculitis. Of the ten patients who survived five had alternative explanations for hepatic dysfunction including sepsis (two), febrile neutropenia (one), and hepatobiliary disorders unlikely to be causally related to short term brentuximab use (two)."^^xsd:string)

