# Individual: X2015_m_brentuximab_and_hepatic_disorders_2nd:sepsisAndDiseaseProgressionAsTheCauseOfTheAE (sepsis and disease progression as the cause of the AE)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2015_m_brentuximab_and_hepatic_disorders_2nd:sepsisAndDiseaseProgressionAsTheCauseOfTheAE "sepsis and disease progression as the cause of the AE"^^xsd:string)
