DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:ibuprofen_and_possible_arrhythmogenic_potential "Ibuprofen has shown a possible arrhythmogenic potential both in vitro and in vivo.12 This is however not labelled for ibuprofen13 and the clinical significance is unclear."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase2 (info for case 2)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase2 "info for case 2"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase2)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase2 "One case was concomitantly taking other drugs, such as ramipiril and nicorandil, that indicated underlying heart problems. "^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase3 (info for case 3)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase3 "info for case 3"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase3)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase3 "In one of these cases, case 3, the patient, who was previously on amiodarone, had taken desloratadine and alfusozin for the first time in the morning of the day of the event."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase6 (info for case 6)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase6 "info for case 6"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase6)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase6 "In one case the patient had diabetes, which is a known risk factor for QT prolongation,10 and the patient was also taking enalapril which is indicated for high blood pressure or heart failure, the latter also a known cause for QT prolongation.6 "^^xsd:string)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase6 "In the overdose cases the reporters assessed all drugs as possibly contributing to the QT prolongation and in case 6 and 9 the reporters assessed desloratadine as the probable cause of the reaction."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase7 (info for case 7)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase7 "info for case 7"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase7)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase7 "Although not stated, it is possible that a fourth case, the patient in case 7 who also tried to commit suicide by ingesting 335 mg of desloratadine and 6000 mg of ibuprofen, had a rapid time to onset since the patient assumedly went to hospital quite soon after the suicide attempt and the electrocardiogram was probably taken at this point."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase8 (info for case 8)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase8 "info for case 8"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase8)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase8 "In the other case, case 8, the patient took desloratadine, isotretionin, quetiapine and loperamide in large doses in an attempt to commit suicide: desloratadine was taken with a dose of 50 mg and quetiapine in a total dose of 2250 mg. "^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase9 (info for case 9)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase9 "info for case 9"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase9)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase9 "In one case the patient was taking levothyroxine, presumably for hypothyroidism, which if not well treated can manifest with cardiac abnormalities and there are a few reports in literature of prolonged QT interval in hypothyroid patients.11 "^^xsd:string)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoForCase9 "In the overdose cases the reporters assessed all drugs as possibly contributing to the QT prolongation and in case 6 and 9 the reporters assessed desloratadine as the probable cause of the reaction."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoFroCase5 (info for case 5)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoFroCase5 "info for case 5"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoFroCase5)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:infoFroCase5 "In case 5 the reporter first assessed desloratadine as possibly related to the reaction but then removed QT prolongation from the list of ADRs with the motivation that it was only slight. In the other reports no causality assessments were made."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:info_for_case_1 (info for case 1)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:info_for_case_1 "info for case 1"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:info_for_case_1)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_desloratadine_and_qt_prolongation_2nd:info_for_case_1 "The third case that had a time to onset within the same day, case 1, reported ibuprofen as a concomitant drug but had no drugs co-suspected."^^xsd:string)

