# Individual: X2015_m_Prucalopride__3rd_2015:Anxiety_and_depression_reported_in_Clinical_trials_of_prucalopride (Anxiety and depression reported in Clinical trials of prucalopride)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2015_m_Prucalopride__3rd_2015:Anxiety_and_depression_reported_in_Clinical_trials_of_prucalopride "Anxiety and depression reported in Clinical trials of prucalopride"^^xsd:string)
