DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_atomoxetine_and_pediatric_patients_4rth_2015:MechanismOfAtomoxetine "Atomoxetine is a relatively potent inhibitor of the presynaptic noradrenaline transporter, a moderate inhibitor of 5HT uptake, and a weak inhibitor of dopamine uptake with minimal affinity for the other noradrenergic receptors. Atomoxetine has moderate affinity for 5HT2 and GABAA receptors but poor affinity for most other receptors."^^xsd:string)

