DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_vemurafenib_tls_4th:labelOfVemurafenib "According to the approved EU SPC the most common side effects of vemurafenib treatment are arthralgia, fatigue, skin reactions, light sensitivity reactions, nausea, alopecia and pruritus.3 TLS, or signs and symptoms associated with TLS such as acute renal failure, other renal side effects, hyperuricaemia, hypocalcaemia, hyperphosphataemia, and hyperkalaemia are not labelled side effects of vemurafenib according to the EU SPC."^^xsd:string)

