ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2015_m_vemurafenib_tls_4th:mechanism_of_TLS X2015_m_vemurafenib_tls_4th:Ref.2)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_vemurafenib_tls_4th:mechanism_of_TLS "The detailed mechanism by which TLS is induced in malignant melanoma and other malignancies is largely unknown although any drug causing death of cancer cells by any mechanism may lead to TLS in certain circumstances. In lymphatic tumours, corticosteroids may induce the production of endonucleases in the malignant cells of melanoma, which leads to DNA fragmentation and eventually cell lysis.2"^^xsd:string)

