# Individual: X2015_m_dextromethorphan_2015_5th:Literature_and_labelling (Literature and labelling)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2015_m_dextromethorphan_2015_5th:Literature_and_labelling "Literature and labelling"^^xsd:string)
