ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2015_m_dextromethorphan_2015_5th:UK_SmPC X2015_m_dextromethorphan_2015_5th:Ref.1)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_dextromethorphan_2015_5th:UK_SmPC "In the summary of product characteristics (SmPC) for several products containing multiple ingredients including dextromethorphan, coma is listed in the section for overdoses but for drugs containing only dextromethorphan in the United Kingdom, coma is not listed as a possible ADR other than as a contraindication in patients using MAO-inhibitors.1"^^xsd:string)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_dextromethorphan_2015_5th:UK_SmPC "It is approved for children and adults above 6 years of age in the United Kingdom and above 4 years of age in the United States.1,2 Most dextromethorphan containing products in the United Kingdom are however indicated from the age of 12.1"^^xsd:string)

