# Individual: X2015_m_Olanzapine_and_accidental_drug_intake_by_children_5th:Discussion_and_conclusion (Discussion and conclusion)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2015_m_Olanzapine_and_accidental_drug_intake_by_children_5th:Discussion_and_conclusion "Discussion and conclusion"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Conclusion X2015_m_Olanzapine_and_accidental_drug_intake_by_children_5th:Discussion_and_conclusion)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Discussion X2015_m_Olanzapine_and_accidental_drug_intake_by_children_5th:Discussion_and_conclusion)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_Olanzapine_and_accidental_drug_intake_by_children_5th:Discussion_and_conclusion "This notice aims to further highlight the issue of a continuing problem with children getting access to potentially harmful drugs. This is especially important to bear in mind when prescribing drugs to parents for indications likely to reflect decreased risk awareness. It should be stressed that, when available, blister packages are the preferred choice for parents with young children."^^xsd:string)

