ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2015_m_Desloratadine_and_aggressive_reaction_6th:Mechanism_of_desloratadine_entering_CNS X2015_m_Desloratadine_and_aggressive_reaction_6th:Ref.15)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2015_m_Desloratadine_and_aggressive_reaction_6th:Mechanism_of_desloratadine_entering_CNS "It is inconclusive whether the limited penetration of second-generation antihistamines into CNS is determined by active efflux from the brain via P-glycoprotein (P-gp) or a restricted penetration through the blood-brain barrier.13,14,15"^^xsd:string)

