DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2016_m_vemurafenib_and_atrial_fibrillation_1st_2016:Mechanism_of_vemurafenib "Vemurafenib is a tyrosine kinase inhibitor. It inhibits some mutated forms of BRAF serinethreonine kinase, including BRAF V600E."^^xsd:string)

