DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2016_m_vemurafenib_and_atrial_fibrillation_1st_2016:time_to_onset_info "Time from starting vemurafenib to onset of atrial fibrillation ranged from 12 days to seven months (15 reports). The time to onset was 12 to 19 days for six patients and between three and seven months for seven patients. Time to onset for the two other patients was 60 days (but 18 days from addition of a potentially interacting medicine) and 37 days."^^xsd:string)

