# Individual: X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:LiteratureAndLabelling (Literature and Labelling)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:LiteratureAndLabelling "Literature and Labelling"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Literature_information X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:LiteratureAndLabelling)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:LiteratureAndLabelling X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:Ref.1)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:LiteratureAndLabelling X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:Ref.10)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:LiteratureAndLabelling X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:Ref.11)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:LiteratureAndLabelling X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:Ref.12)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:LiteratureAndLabelling X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:Ref.13)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:LiteratureAndLabelling X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:Ref.4)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:LiteratureAndLabelling X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:Ref.8)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:LiteratureAndLabelling X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:Ref.9)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2016_m_levetiracetam_and_impaired_renal_function_2nd_2016:LiteratureAndLabelling "In addition to the published case reports on levetiracetam with ARF and/or interstitial nephritis4,8,9 included in this assessment, there is a possible renal tubular disorder reported in a 23- year-old male who developed hypokalaemia and hypomagnesaemia but had normal serum creatinine.11 Another 23-year-old received
1000 mg levetiracetam and 2 mg lorazepam at the hospital for new onset seizures.12 Creatinine was normal before admission to hospital and started to increase the following day. Patient recovered after stopping levetiracetam and changing to phenytoin. A 69-year-old woman, who after two weeks treatment with levetiracetam presented with severe mouth mucosal ulceration secondary to herpes simplex virus, and feeling unwell with wide spread rash, elevated creatinine, leukocyte count and because of worsening azotaemia she needed haemodialysis. Levetiracetam was changed to valproic acid and her renal function gradually improved.10
Impaired renal function or related events are not described as adverse reactions in the product information for levetiracetam.1,13"^^xsd:string)

