DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2016_m_dabigatran_3rd_2016:DosageForDabigatran "The recommended daily doses of dabigatran for NVAF are 300 mg and, for older patients and patients with creatinine clearance 30 to 50 ml/min, 220 mg daily in two divided doses. For prevention of VTE after major orthopaedic surgery the corresponding recommended daily doses are 220 mg and 150 mg.  "^^xsd:string)
