ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_adverse_effect X2016_m_dabigatran_3rd_2016:case_report X2016_m_dabigatran_3rd_2016:atrial_thrombosis)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_drug X2016_m_dabigatran_3rd_2016:case_report X2016_m_dabigatran_3rd_2016:dabigatran)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2016_m_dabigatran_3rd_2016:case_report X2016_m_dabigatran_3rd_2016:Ref.17)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2016_m_dabigatran_3rd_2016:case_report "Finally, one case report described dabigatran failure in preventing recurrent deep vein thrombosis in an 80-year old patient. This patient had a history of paroxysmal atrial fibrillation ten years prior and several risk factors: intensive parachuting career, venous insufficiency, three past events of DVT, insertion of an inferior vena cava filter (18 years prior), mild obesity and the presence of a pacemaker.17"^^xsd:string)

