# Individual: X2016_m_dabigatran_3rd_2016:timeToOnset2b (time to onset 2b)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2016_m_dabigatran_3rd_2016:timeToOnset2b "time to onset 2b"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(time:DurationDescription X2016_m_dabigatran_3rd_2016:timeToOnset2b)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2016_m_dabigatran_3rd_2016:timeToOnset2b "Time to onset was stated for 28 patients and ranged from one day to three years. Nineteen patients experienced the reaction within the first four months, whereas for the other patients the time to onset ranged from five months to three years.  "^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2016_m_dabigatran_3rd_2016:timeToOnsetFor1b (time to onset for 1b)

