ClassAssertion(time:DurationDescription X2016_m_dabigatran_3rd_2016:timeToOnsetFor1b)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2016_m_dabigatran_3rd_2016:timeToOnsetFor1b "Time to onset (recorded for 21 patients) ranged from 14 hours to 9 months. Seventeen patients experienced the reaction within the first 18 days, whereas for the other four patients the times to onset were one month (two patients), two months and nine months."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2016_m_dabigatran_3rd_2016:timeToOnsetReport2a.1 (time to onset report 2a)

