ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_adverse_effect X2016_m_thiamazole_and_rhabdomyolysis_4rth_2016:labellingOfThiamazole X2016_m_thiamazole_and_rhabdomyolysis_4rth_2016:rhabdomyolysis)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_drug X2016_m_thiamazole_and_rhabdomyolysis_4rth_2016:labellingOfThiamazole X2016_m_thiamazole_and_rhabdomyolysis_4rth_2016:thiamazole)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2016_m_thiamazole_and_rhabdomyolysis_4rth_2016:labellingOfThiamazole X2016_m_thiamazole_and_rhabdomyolysis_4rth_2016:Ref.3)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2016_m_thiamazole_and_rhabdomyolysis_4rth_2016:labellingOfThiamazole "The product literature does not refer to rhabdomyolysis although it does mention myalgia as a possible adverse reaction. In the literature, there is one report describing rhabdomyolysis in association with thiamazole, interpreted as Case 18 in Table 1.3 This was reported as the first reported case of such an association."^^xsd:string)

