# Individual: X2016_m_dimenhydrinate_and_erythema_multifore_5th:reportInSupportOfCausality (report in support of causality)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2016_m_dimenhydrinate_and_erythema_multifore_5th:reportInSupportOfCausality "report in support of causality"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(obo:OAE_0001197 X2016_m_dimenhydrinate_and_erythema_multifore_5th:reportInSupportOfCausality)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2016_m_dimenhydrinate_and_erythema_multifore_5th:reportInSupportOfCausality "Only one case is indicative of a dimenhydrinate-induced SJS; it involves a 22- year-old female who was hospitalized, and later died, due to SJS/TEN after the prescription of dimenhydrinate a month earlier"^^xsd:string)

