# Individual: X2016_m_denosumab_and_lichen_planus_6th_2016:possibleMechanismForLichenPlanusByDenosumab (possible mechanism for lichen planus by denosumab)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2016_m_denosumab_and_lichen_planus_6th_2016:possibleMechanismForLichenPlanusByDenosumab "possible mechanism for lichen planus by denosumab"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Adverse_Effect_Mechanism X2016_m_denosumab_and_lichen_planus_6th_2016:possibleMechanismForLichenPlanusByDenosumab)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_adverse_effect X2016_m_denosumab_and_lichen_planus_6th_2016:possibleMechanismForLichenPlanusByDenosumab X2016_m_denosumab_and_lichen_planus_6th_2016:lichen_planus)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_class X2016_m_denosumab_and_lichen_planus_6th_2016:possibleMechanismForLichenPlanusByDenosumab X2016_m_denosumab_and_lichen_planus_6th_2016:tnf-aAntagonists)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2016_m_denosumab_and_lichen_planus_6th_2016:possibleMechanismForLichenPlanusByDenosumab X2016_m_denosumab_and_lichen_planus_6th_2016:Ref.7)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2016_m_denosumab_and_lichen_planus_6th_2016:possibleMechanismForLichenPlanusByDenosumab X2016_m_denosumab_and_lichen_planus_6th_2016:Ref.8)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2016_m_denosumab_and_lichen_planus_6th_2016:possibleMechanismForLichenPlanusByDenosumab X2016_m_denosumab_and_lichen_planus_6th_2016:Ref.9)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2016_m_denosumab_and_lichen_planus_6th_2016:possibleMechanismForLichenPlanusByDenosumab "It has been suggested that TNF-α inhibition may precipitate lichenoid reactions through disruption of a delicate balance between TNF-α and interferon-α in susceptible patients .7 Another suggested hypothesis is that the inhibition of TNF-α allows upregulation of other precursor pro-inflammatory cytokines, such as interferon-α, which causes activation of both T cells and dendritic cells.8 Since RANKL is a member of the TNF superfamily, it is possible that denosumab may cause LP through a similar mechanism "^^xsd:string)

