DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2016_m_denosumab_vasculitis_6th:NoReportingForVasculitisInDenosumab "The product literature does not refer to vasculitis nor does it refer to any other vascular reactions. It notes that the skin reactions rash and eczema are common and that cases of cellulitis have been reported uncommonly.1 There are also no reports of vasculitis in association with denosumab in the medical literature . "^^xsd:string)

