DataPropertyAssertion(mp:citation X2017_m_chymotrypsin_1st:ChymotrypsinAndAnaphylacticShock "Websites presenting product information for chymotrypsin usually contain warnings and information on serious and severe allergic side effects; in most web sources anaphylactic shock is specifically mentioned. "^^xsd:string)

