# Individual: X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:ReyData (Rey data)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:ReyData "Rey data"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(obo:OAE_0001197 X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:ReyData)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_adverse_effect X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:ReyData X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:hearingLoss)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_drug X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:ReyData X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:lamivudine)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_drug X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:ReyData X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:nevirapine)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_drug X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:ReyData X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:stavudine)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:ReyData X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:Ref.22)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:ReyData "In another remarkable case-report, Rey et al. highlighted a case from France of a 23-year-old female medical student who was administered ART combination of stavudine-lamivudine-nevirapine for post-exposure prophylaxis. She was prescribed nevirapine for four days and the other two for one month. Less than two weeks after the end of NRTI treatment she developed sudden bilateral hearing loss, with partial recovery after several months. No abnormality was found despite an in-depth investigation. She remained HIV negative after six months.22 It is likely that this patient is case 12 of the VigiBase® case series in Table 1 "^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:SchoutenData (Schouten data)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:SchoutenData "Schouten data"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(obo:OAE_0001182 X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:SchoutenData)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_class X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:SchoutenData <http://purl.org/OpenPVSignal/Signals/2017_1_lamivudine_hearingDecreased.owl#Nucleoside/Nucleotide_Reverse_Transcriptase_Inhibitors_(NRTI_or_NtRTI)>)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_drug X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:SchoutenData X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:didanosine)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_drug X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:SchoutenData X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:zidovudine)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:SchoutenData X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:Ref.24)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2017_m_Lamivudine_2017_1st:SchoutenData "Schouten et al. performed a longitudinal, prospective study of the hearing changes following zidovudine and didanosine therapy, both NRTIs, over a 32-week period. This study measured changes in hearing levels at all frequencies and also in low- and high-frequency, pure tone averages. No significant changes were observed. Lamivudine was not evaluated in this study. 24 "^^xsd:string)

