# Individual: X2017_m_sglt2_inhibitors_3rd:Discussion_and_conclusion (Discussion and conclusion)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2017_m_sglt2_inhibitors_3rd:Discussion_and_conclusion "Discussion and conclusion"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Conclusion X2017_m_sglt2_inhibitors_3rd:Discussion_and_conclusion)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Discussion X2017_m_sglt2_inhibitors_3rd:Discussion_and_conclusion)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2017_m_sglt2_inhibitors_3rd:Discussion_and_conclusion "aim of communication is to highlight that some events can be characterised as nonserious in the clinical trial setting but may manifest in the post marketing period as severe events which have a large enough impact on the quality of life for the patient that discontinuing the medication is necessary. Additionally, more guidance by drug developers or regulators on how to manage these effects may be necessary to ensure that patients who receive benefit from taking the medications are able to remain compliant with them."^^xsd:string)

