DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2017_m_sglt2_inhibitors_3rd:No_causality_established_by_prior_clinical_trials_for_SGLT2_and_genital_infections "There was no evidence of a relationship between the incidence of genital infections and the amount of glycosuria observed in the clinical trials"^^xsd:string)

