# Individual: X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:JAKInhibitorsAndPeripheralNeuropathy (JAK inhibitors and peripheral neuropathy)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:JAKInhibitorsAndPeripheralNeuropathy "JAK inhibitors and peripheral neuropathy"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(obo:OAE_0001197 X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:JAKInhibitorsAndPeripheralNeuropathy)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Clinical_trial_information X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:JAKInhibitorsAndPeripheralNeuropathy)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:concerns_indication_for_use X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:JAKInhibitorsAndPeripheralNeuropathy X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:myelofibrosis)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_adverse_effect X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:JAKInhibitorsAndPeripheralNeuropathy X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:neuropathyPeripheral)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_class X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:JAKInhibitorsAndPeripheralNeuropathy X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:JAKInhibitors)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:JAKInhibitorsAndPeripheralNeuropathy X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:Ref.14)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:JAKInhibitorsAndPeripheralNeuropathy X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:Ref.15)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:JAKInhibitorsAndPeripheralNeuropathy X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:Ref.16)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2017_m_ruxolitinib_4th:JAKInhibitorsAndPeripheralNeuropathy "For some other JAK inhibitors, peripheral neuropathy has been commonly observed. At one institution, treatment-emergent peripheral neuropathy was documented in 44 of 100 myelofibrosis patients treated with the JAK1/2 inhibitor momelotinib,14 and with XL019, a selective JAK2 inhibitor, peripheral neuropathy was observed in seven out of nine patients in a phase 1 trial.15 This substance was also used in a study of 30 patients with myelofibrosis where central and/or peripheral neurotoxicity (including later onset of classical “glove and stocking” sensory peripheral neuropathy) developed in all patients, leading to termination of the study ."^^xsd:string)

