# Individual: X2017_m_libido_5th:conclusion (conclusion)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2017_m_libido_5th:conclusion "conclusion"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Conclusion X2017_m_libido_5th:conclusion)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2017_m_libido_5th:conclusion "These reports highlight the importance of helping consumers make well-informed decisions about their treatments and being aware of potential adverse reactions.Users who lose their libido while on these contraceptives might need to change their method of birth control in order to sustain their life quality and reduce the risk of noncompliance. A clearer message in the patient information leaflet about the potential loss of libido is recommended ."^^xsd:string)

