DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2018_ivermectin_1st:Clinical_trial_information_for_ivermectin "The neurological events of dizziness (2.8%), somnolence (0.9%), vertigo (0.9%), and tremor (0.9%) were observed in human clinical trials for the treatment of strongyloidiasis, while drug-related headache (0.2%) was observed in trials for onchocerciasis; these events are included in the product label."^^xsd:string)

