# Individual: X2018_ivermectin_1st:Pharmacokinetics_of_ivermectin (Pharmacokinetics of ivermectin)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2018_ivermectin_1st:Pharmacokinetics_of_ivermectin "Pharmacokinetics of ivermectin"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Mechanism X2018_ivermectin_1st:Pharmacokinetics_of_ivermectin)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2018_ivermectin_1st:Pharmacokinetics_of_ivermectin X2018_ivermectin_1st:Ref.3)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2018_ivermectin_1st:Pharmacokinetics_of_ivermectin "Ivermectin is not thought to readily cross the bloodbrain barrier in humans, as it is excluded by a Pglycoprotein drug pump (mdr-1). Therefore, it has been considered to be free of the potential to cause neurological adverse drug reactions, except in situations of overdose.3"^^xsd:string)

