DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2018_m_Quetiapine_2nd:CaseReportInfo6 "Cases 5 and 6 are confounded by  respiratory infection and NMS respectively."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2018_m_Quetiapine_2nd:CaseReportInfo7 (Case report info 7)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2018_m_Quetiapine_2nd:CaseReportInfo7 "Case report info 7"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2018_m_Quetiapine_2nd:CaseReportInfo7)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2018_m_Quetiapine_2nd:CaseReportInfo7 "In case 7, marked increases of  antipsychotic plasma levels due to  pharmacokinetic interaction could have  induced NMS."^^xsd:string)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2018_m_Quetiapine_2nd:CaseReportInfo7 "Q above studied doses. Mental disorders
due to brain damage. Chronic obstructive
pulmonary disease, smoker, fever 38.1 C. Q
plasma concentration: 3498 nmol/l
(reference 183-442 nmol/l) 1 day after
withdrawal. C-reactive protein: 83 mg/l.
Pipamperone was taken for 9 days, in
overlap with Q/VA."^^xsd:string)

