DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2018_m_artemether_2nd_2018:Survey_in_Uganda "In an article describing an ADR reporting survey performed in Uganda one case is described as reported from a doctor where a “52 year old female on Coartem oral route developed sores on the whole body”. No further information is available on the case which can be suspected of describing SJS or TEN.9"^^xsd:string)

