DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2019_m_vemurafenib_3rd:δδ "In the nine reports in which the patient recovered, both cobimetinib and vemurafenib were withdrawn in four cases, cobimetinib was withdrawn and vemurafenib continued in four cases and cobimetinib withdrawn and the action taken with vemurafenib unknown in the other case. This dechallenge information appears to favour cobimetinib as the more likely drug."^^xsd:string)

