DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2018_m_desogestrel_2018_5th:Onset_time_for_Report_3 "I did never suspect Cerazette to have any role in my anxiety or panic attacks before I stopped the drug and realized that my problems went away. Thinking back, I realize that my problems started in the same period as I started taking Cerazette"^^xsd:string)

