DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2018_m_Aflibercept_6th_2018:Clinical_trial_report_for_Aflibercept "within a review of clinical trial data supplied to the US FDA, an exploratory subgroup analysis in a Phase 3 study (VIEW2) was identified which did not reveal any clinically relevant influence of gender on the plasma concentrations of free aflibercept or aflibercept:VEGF complex"^^xsd:string)
