DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2018_m_Aflibercept_6th_2018:EU_labelling "The EU labelling for aflibercept notes that gender was found to be a significant covariate for explaining the inter-individual variability of free aflibercept clearance and volume. Males exhibited a 15.5% higher clearance and a 20.6% higher volume of distribution compared to females."^^xsd:string)

