ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2018_m_Aflibercept_6th_2018:Epidemiological__studies_regarding_gender-specific_baseline_risk_for__DVT X2018_m_Aflibercept_6th_2018:Ref.10)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2018_m_Aflibercept_6th_2018:Epidemiological__studies_regarding_gender-specific_baseline_risk_for__DVT X2018_m_Aflibercept_6th_2018:Ref.3)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2018_m_Aflibercept_6th_2018:Epidemiological__studies_regarding_gender-specific_baseline_risk_for__DVT X2018_m_Aflibercept_6th_2018:Ref.9)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2018_m_Aflibercept_6th_2018:Epidemiological__studies_regarding_gender-specific_baseline_risk_for__DVT "There are conflicting results from epidemiological studies regarding gender-specific baseline risk for DVT 3,9-10. In the most recent publication on this topic, an increased risk in men was estimated, and the authors note that “…the pathophysiology behind these observations has yet to be unravelled” and “… this risk difference may have implications for future sex- specific treatment and prevention strategies for venous thrombosis.” 9"^^xsd:string)

