DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2018_m_brivudine_5fu_6th_2018:AEMPS "In a recent issue of the WHO Pharmaceuticals Newsletter, the concerns of the Agencia Española de Medicamentos y Productos Sanitarios (AEMPS) in Spain about the continued fatal cases, were reported, alongside reiterated warnings to healthcare professionals.21"^^xsd:string)

