# Individual: X2018_m_ceftriaxone_2018_6th:Discussion_and_Conclusion (Discussion and Conclusion)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2018_m_ceftriaxone_2018_6th:Discussion_and_Conclusion "Discussion and Conclusion"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Conclusion X2018_m_ceftriaxone_2018_6th:Discussion_and_Conclusion)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2018_m_ceftriaxone_2018_6th:Discussion_and_Conclusion X2018_m_ceftriaxone_2018_6th:Ref.1)
