ObjectPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:refers_to_drug X2018_m_ceftriaxone_2018_6th:Longo_et_al__report X2018_m_ceftriaxone_2018_6th:Ceftriaxone)
ObjectPropertyAssertion(mp:references X2018_m_ceftriaxone_2018_6th:Longo_et_al__report X2018_m_ceftriaxone_2018_6th:Ref.5)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2018_m_ceftriaxone_2018_6th:Longo_et_al__report "Longo et al described an 80-year-old male who developed hepatitis shortly after starting oral ceftriaxone. Although transaminases returned to baseline after ceftriaxone withdrawal, there was development of haemolytic anaemia and erythoblastocytopenia.5"^^xsd:string)

