DataPropertyAssertion(mp:citation X2019_m_levofloxacin_1st:BlackBoxWarningForFluoroquinolones "A recent US FDA Black Box Warning for
fluoroquinolones advises restriction of the use of
these antibiotics in infections for which a choice of
antibiotics is available, because of serious reactions
including CNS effects.1 Dose adjustment in renal
failure, careful review of co-prescriptions and
monitoring of patients with predisposing CNS
conditions should also reduce the possibility of
myoclonus and seizures."^^xsd:string)

