DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2019_m_levofloxacin_1st:Fluoroquinolones_and_NMDA_receptors "Fluoroquinolones are known to cause central nervous system (CNS) adverse effects such as hallucinations and seizures.1 These effects are likely to be the result of excitation of N-methyl-Daspartate (NMDA) receptors and inhibition of gamma-aminobutyric acid (GABA-A) receptors"^^xsd:string)

