# Individual: X2019_m_levofloxacin_1st:LevofloxacinAndCNSReactions (US FDA label and UK SmPC for Levofloxacin-Fluoroquinolones and CNS reactions)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2019_m_levofloxacin_1st:LevofloxacinAndCNSReactions "US FDA label and UK SmPC for Levofloxacin-Fluoroquinolones and CNS reactions"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(obo:OAE_0001197 X2019_m_levofloxacin_1st:LevofloxacinAndCNSReactions)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Structured_Product_Labels_information X2019_m_levofloxacin_1st:LevofloxacinAndCNSReactions)
