# Individual: X2019_m_Esomeprazole_and_gynaecomastia_in_obese_adults_2nd_2019:InfoForPatient1 (Info for patient 1)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2019_m_Esomeprazole_and_gynaecomastia_in_obese_adults_2nd_2019:InfoForPatient1 "Info for patient 1"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2019_m_Esomeprazole_and_gynaecomastia_in_obese_adults_2nd_2019:InfoForPatient1)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2019_m_Esomeprazole_and_gynaecomastia_in_obese_adults_2nd_2019:InfoForPatient1 "An adult male obese patient (BMI=36.2), age not given, had taken esomeprazole for gastroesophageal reflux and diclofenac for pain during an unknown period. He presented enlargement after an unstated time. He did not smoke and reported very little alcohol consumption. There was no reference as to follow-up nor whether the breast enlargement was resolved."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2019_m_Esomeprazole_and_gynaecomastia_in_obese_adults_2nd_2019:InfoForPatient2 (Info for patient 2)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label X2019_m_Esomeprazole_and_gynaecomastia_in_obese_adults_2nd_2019:InfoForPatient2 "Info for patient 2"^^xsd:string)
ClassAssertion(OpenPVSignal:Case_Report_Information X2019_m_Esomeprazole_and_gynaecomastia_in_obese_adults_2nd_2019:InfoForPatient2)
DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2019_m_Esomeprazole_and_gynaecomastia_in_obese_adults_2nd_2019:InfoForPatient2 "A 77-year old slightly obese man (BMI=31.6) was taking esomeprazole (between January and August 2016) for haemorrhage of digestive tract and spironolactone for heart failure. Breast enlargement was noted in July, so both drugs were suspended in early August and the problem resolved. However, due to a recurrence of gastric symptoms, esomeprazole was reintroduced at the end of the same month. Breast enlargement did not recur. There is no mention that spironolactone was also added to his regimen."^^xsd:string)

# Individual: X2019_m_Esomeprazole_and_gynaecomastia_in_obese_adults_2nd_2019:Initial_dose_for_report_4 (Initial dose for report 4)

