DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2019_m_etanercept_and_opthalmic_herpes_3rd_2019:conclusion "Although infections and eye inflammation are listed in the patient information leaflet for etanercept, without clear information about the risk of acquiring ophthalmic herpes and more specifically, the risks of leaving it untreated, there is a risk of permanent damage to the sight of the patients who are not treated in time."^^xsd:string)

