LNG-IUSs can provide contraception for three or five years, depending on the device. LNG-IUSs are considered long acting reversible contraception (LARC) and are listed among the most effective contraceptive methods because they do not depend on compliance from the user. In addition to their high efficacy, LNG- IUSs are commonly used because of their safety, ease of use, and cost effectiveness.1,2,3 The LNG-IUS products are available in multiple formulations (52 mg, 19.5 mg and 13.5 mg LNG)."^^xsd:string)

