DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2019_m_vortioxetine_and_aggression_2019_5th:supporting_evidence "Supporting evidence for possible causality from the case series are the wide geographic distribution of cases, a lack of evidence that aggression was part of a larger clinical syndrome in 26 cases, vortioxetine as the only reported drug in 42 reports (and the only suspected drug in 29 additional reports with concomitant medication), and the documentation of a positive de-challenge in 15 cases."^^xsd:string)

