DataPropertyAssertion(OpenPVSignal:has_content X2019_m_levonergestrel_6th_2019:Mechanism_of_LNG_IUD "LNG-IUDs emit a low and constant hormonal dose released directly into the uterus and its endometrium. LNG-IUDs are marketed around the world and available in several strengths (52 mg,19.5 mg and 13.5 mg levonorgestrel).1, 2 The contraceptive effect of LNG-IUDs is achieved through changes in cervical mucus inhibiting the passage of sperm, suppressed proliferation of the endometrium, and, in some women, suppression of ovulation.1-3"^^xsd:string)

